Description: Brazilian Portuguese for the sentences of ORDER 61f
 The sentences the patches 0021 and 0022 add (a still's mark written into JPEG
 pictures only, a render that writes fewer bits than its deepest clip), in
 Brazilian Portuguese; the other eight required languages are the translations
 lane's.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-21
diff --git a/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po b/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po
--- a/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po
+++ b/po/pt_BR/kdenlive.po
@@ -48065,3 +48065,13 @@ msgstr "Linhas entrelaçadas"
 msgctxt "The video shown in 3D by the compositor, in the monitor itself"
 msgid "3D"
 msgstr "3D"
+
+msgctxt "Why a 3D correction could not be saved into a file"
+msgid "the 3D mark of a still is written into JPEG pictures (JPS, MPO) only, and this picture is another format."
+msgstr "a marca 3D de uma imagem estática é gravada só em imagens JPEG (JPS, MPO), e esta imagem é de outro formato."
+
+msgid "The deepest clip of this project has %1 bits a sample and this render writes %2: its pictures keep fewer levels of each colour than the clip. The 3D FFV1 preset keeps up to 16 bits, the 3D HEVC presets up to 12."
+msgstr "O clipe de maior profundidade de cor deste projeto tem %1 bits por amostra e esta renderização grava %2: as imagens dela guardam menos níveis de cada cor que o clipe. A predefinição 3D FFV1 guarda até 16 bits; as predefinições 3D HEVC, até 12."
+
+msgid "The render goes ahead:"
+msgstr "A renderização continua:"
